=====================================================================
WHAT WOULD MAKE THIS PASS
=====================================================================
Add an emptiness assertion beside the scan at Makefile:179-180 so that a
scan matching nothing is a hard make error rather than a silent loss of all
six guards. Nothing else in criteria 3-10 is outstanding. I did not repair
it; that is the worker's edit, not mine.
